ids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle saw Oct-Nov at 42% of normal and Sep-Oct at 46%. So far in 2026 the middle had May to June at 200% and March to April at 47%. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 14283 at 51%.</p>"}
